# local env files
#
# Ignored as a family rather than listed one at a time: a new secrets file that
# is not added here would otherwise be committed on the very first `git add -A`,
# and these files hold the database password, AUTH_SECRET, the Razorpay secret
# and the SES SMTP password. `.env.example` is the only one that belongs in the
# repository, so it is re-included explicitly.
.env*
!.env.example

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# prisma local artefacts
prisma/dev.db
prisma/dev.db-journal
